{"id":"vod_lz_11754","vodId":"11754","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"魔法禁书目录","name_cn":"魔法禁书目录","date":"2008-01-01","year":"2008","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20220428-1/ec5fb1b3320634013bf53be55c8f2cd2.jpg"},"summary":"自己的阳台栏杆上出现了像被单一样挂在上面的少女，这种非现实的情节出现在了上条当麻的眼前。虽然在这个城市——最先进科学引导的学院都市中，超能力已经可以通过科学技术创造出来，但是眼前这位自称“茵蒂克丝”的少女还是把上条当麻吓了一条。茵蒂克丝自称因拥有十万三千本魔导书而被魔法师追杀，而上条当麻靠自己的超能力也认定了少女的魔法。少女以危险为由离开上条家，上条如往日一般去学校学习，但放学回家，却发现茵蒂克丝倒在血泊之中。在科学与魔术交叉的世界中，上条当麻与茵蒂克丝的故事开始了。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2022-04-28 16:42:57","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220428/12959_d0107fea/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220428/12961_4aab78a5/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220428/12960_637ca92d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220428/12962_adbfccea/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220428/12964_a77c5fb6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220428/12963_f8dc622b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220428/12967_90f63b5d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220428/12965_79f35b55/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220428/12966_5a17de9f/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220428/12969_77f5b886/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220428/12968_66ef4bac/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220428/12970_8551ae5f/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220428/12972_d35f2398/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220428/12971_df75e545/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220428/129